---
// Arithmetic for a 2-CPU limit (quota 200 ms per 100 ms window): 6 busy threads use the quota in 200 / 6 = 33 ms.
const x0 = 200;
const sc = 6.8; // px per ms, 0..100 ms
const X = (ms: number) => x0 + ms * sc;
const runEnd = 200 / 6; // 33.3 ms
---
<figure class="gp14f">
  <div class="gp14f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 270" role="img" aria-label="One 100 millisecond CFS window with a limit of 2 CPUs, which is 200 milliseconds of CPU time. With GOMAXPROCS 6, six busy threads use all 200 milliseconds in about 33 milliseconds and every thread then waits about 67 milliseconds. With GOMAXPROCS 2, two threads run the whole window.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One 100 ms window, limit 2 CPUs (200 ms of CPU time)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một cửa sổ 100 ms, giới hạn 2 CPU (200 ms thời gian CPU)</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="20" y="72" class="b">GOMAXPROCS = 6</text>
    <text x="20" y="92" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>host CPU count</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>số CPU của máy</tspan></text>
    <rect x={X(0)} y="52" width={runEnd * sc} height="44" rx="4" class="box" style="fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text)" />
    <text x={X(0) + 12} y="79"><tspan data-lang-en>6 threads run</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>6 thread chạy</tspan></text>
    <rect x={X(runEnd)} y="52" width={(100 - runEnd) * sc} height="44" rx="4" class="bad" />
    <text x={X(runEnd) + 12} y="79" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>every thread paused for about 67 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mọi thread bị dừng khoảng 67 ms</tspan></text>

    <text x="20" y="152" class="b">GOMAXPROCS = 2</text>
    <text x="20" y="172" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>matches the limit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khớp với giới hạn</tspan></text>
    <rect x={X(0)} y="132" width={100 * sc} height="44" rx="4" class="box" style="fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text)" />
    <text x={X(0) + 12} y="159"><tspan data-lang-en>2 threads run the whole window, the quota lasts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2 thread chạy hết cửa sổ, quota vẫn đủ</tspan></text>

    <line x1={X(0)} x2={X(100)} y1="214" y2="214" class="ln" />
    {[0, 25, 50, 75, 100].map((ms) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={X(ms)} x2={X(ms)} y1="208" y2="214" class="ln" />
        <text x={X(ms)} y="234" text-anchor="middle" class="m num">{ms}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x={X(100)} y="256" text-anchor="end" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>milliseconds in the window</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mili giây trong cửa sổ</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The 33 ms and 67 ms are arithmetic (200 ms of quota divided by 6 busy threads), not measurements. The measured runs are in the text below.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>33 ms và 67 ms là phép tính (200 ms quota chia cho 6 thread đang bận), không phải số đo. Các lần đo thật nằm trong phần chữ bên dưới.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp14f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp14f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp14f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp14f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp14f .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14f .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp14f .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14f .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp14f .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp14f .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14f .own { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp14f .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp14f .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp14f .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp14f .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp14f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
